// expect: refuse E_UnknownArgLabel
// A label names a parameter, and `fatcor` names none of `scale`'s, so the
// call has no field for it and the medium cannot say what the program
// means. Every error refuses the executable. Until 2026-10-16 this class
// reported and the program compiled anyway (41,444 bytes of WAT on boot
// 969f2559), and the module trapped where the label's slot was read.
fn scale(x, factor) = x * factor

fn main() = scale(3, fatcor = 4)
